lace_name":"衢州","place_name_jianti_auto":"衢州","place_note":"浙江省衢州市","resolved_place_entity_id":1478,"start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"c27f73af-db0e-11ef-a2d4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","内政"],"content":"3浙東觀察使裴肅旣以進奉得進，判官齊總代掌後務，刻剝以求媚又過之。三月，癸酉，詔擢總爲衢州刺史。給事中長安許孟容封還詔書，曰：「衢州無他虞，齊總無殊績，忽此超獎，深駭羣情。若總必有可錄，願明書勞課，然後超資改官，以解衆疑。」詔遂留中。己亥，上召孟容，慰獎之。","content_fanyi":"浙东观察使裴肃既因向朝廷进献贡品而得以升迁；裴肃死后，判官齐总代理留后事务，比裴肃更加苛刻地搜刮钱财，再向朝廷进献以讨好德宗。三月十七日癸酉，德宗下诏提升齐总为衢州刺史。给事中长安人许孟容不肯宣读诏书，将这份委任诏书原封退还给德宗，说：“衢州并没有别的忧患，齐总也没有特殊的政绩，忽然如此破格奖励提拔，使众人深感惊异。如果齐总确有可以记录的成绩，希望明确写出他的功劳和考课，然后再超越资历改授官职，以消除众人的疑虑。”于是任命齐总的诏书留在宫中，没有颁布。四月十三日己亥，德宗召见许孟容，加以慰问和奖励。","content_jianti_auto":"3浙东观察使裴肃既以进奉得进，判官齐总代掌后务，刻剥以求媚又过之。三月，癸酉，诏擢总为衢州刺史。给事中长安许孟容封还诏书，曰：「衢州无他虞，齐总无殊绩，忽此超奖，深骇群情。若总必有可录，愿明书劳课，然后超资改官，以解众疑。」诏遂留中。己亥，上召孟容，慰奖之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23774,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c27f7399-db0e-11ef-b66e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"嘉王","people_name_jianti_auto":"嘉王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b2-db0e-11ef-acb8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"運","people_name_jianti_auto":"运","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b3-db0e-11ef-88c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"代宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"代宗","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b4-db0e-11ef-b251-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b5-db0e-11ef-8b54-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東內","place_name_jianti_auto":"东内","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b6-db0e-11ef-86eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"含元殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"含元殿","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b7-db0e-11ef-b50f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西內","place_name_jianti_auto":"西内","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b8-db0e-11ef-aa83-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太極殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"太极殿","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b9-db0e-11ef-9cff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"c27f73ba-db0e-11ef-b436-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"嘉王運，代宗之子。諮議參軍，正五品上，掌計謀議事。唐東內以含元殿爲正牙，西內以太極殿爲正牙。唐制：天子居曰衙，行曰駕。牙，與衙同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"嘉王运，代宗之子。咨议参军，正五品上，掌计谋议事。唐东内以含元殿为正牙，西内以太极殿为正牙。唐制：天子居曰衙，行曰驾。牙，与衙同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b1-db0e-11ef-a221-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"逋，欠也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"逋，欠也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"c27f73bb-db0e-11ef-b907-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"王府属官","official_name":"嘉王府諮議","official_note":"嘉王府諮議是唐代王府中的諮議參軍，負責提供建議和諮詢，屬於文職官員。在上下文中，高弘本擔任此職，並在正牙奏事時自理逋債，引發後續詔令和議論。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"嘉王府諮議高弘本正牙奏事","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"993dec48-1475-4839-b213-9c82cd3f7255"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":838,"link_td_description":"李运，唐朝皇子，是唐代宗李豫第十五子。他的生母不详。","link_td_id":"Q10013527","link_td_number_id":1600473,"people_name":"嘉王","people_name_jianti_auto":"嘉王","people_xingming":"嘉王運","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c27f73bc-db0e-11ef-b678-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高弘本","people_name_jianti_auto":"高弘本","people_xingming":"高弘本","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c27f73bd-db0e-11ef-92c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"弘本","people_name_jianti_auto":"弘本","people_xingming":"高弘本","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"c27f73be-db0e-11ef-b368-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"延英門","place_name_jianti_auto":"延英门","resolved_place_entity_id":3167,"start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"c27f73bf-db0e-11ef-b26d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4秋，七月，辛未，嘉王府諮議高弘本正牙奏事，自理逋債。乙亥，詔「公卿庶僚自今勿令正牙奏事，如有陳奏，宜延英門請對。」議者以爲：「正牙奏事，自武德以來未之或改，所以達羣情，講政事；弘本無知，黜之可也，不當因人而廢事。」","content_fanyi":"秋季，七月十七日辛未，嘉王李运府中的谘议参军高弘本到正殿奏事，陈说自己欠下的债务由本人偿还。七月二十一日乙亥，德宗下诏说：“从今以后，公卿将相及众僚属不要到正殿奏报事情，如有陈奏，应当到延英门请求召对。”议论此事的人认为：“在正殿奏报事情，自武德年间以来从未改变，这是使下情上达、讲议政事的安排；高弘本愚昧无知，将他贬黜免职就可以了，不应当因为一个人而废弃这一制度。”","content_jianti_auto":"4秋，七月，辛未，嘉王府咨议高弘本正牙奏事，自理逋债。乙亥，诏「公卿庶僚自今勿令正牙奏事，如有陈奏，宜延英门请对。」议者以为：「正牙奏事，自武德以来未之或改，所以达群情，讲政事；弘本无知，黜之可也，不当因人而废事。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23775,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c27f73b0-db0e-11ef-9daa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"鍔，五各翻。「副節度使」，恐當作「節度副使」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"锷，五各翻。「副节度使」，恐当作「节度副使」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"c27f73c1-db0e-11ef-ba29-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"淮南節度使","official_note":"淮南節度使是唐代地方高级军政长官，掌管淮南道（今江苏、安徽一带）的军事和行政事务，此处指杜佑担任此职并请求替代。","official_rank":"從二品或正三品","source_snippet":"淮南節度使杜佑累表求代","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"037a856f-98d5-44e8-9a5d-03de661c0a5d"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"刑部尚書","official_note":"刑部尚書是唐代中央刑部的长官，负责司法和刑狱事务，此处王鍔原任此职，后被任命为淮南副節度使。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"以刑部尚書王鍔爲淮南副節度使兼行軍司馬","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"3621bd25-d618-488e-bf2e-75c4d96364e7"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"淮南副節度使","official_note":"淮南副節度使是淮南節度使的副职，协助管理地方军政，此处王鍔被任命为此职。","official_rank":"從三品或正四品","source_snippet":"以刑部尚書王鍔爲淮南副節度使兼行軍司馬","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"a0543d89-b6ee-4275-97be-910fa4ed0193"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"行軍司馬","official_note":"行軍司馬是唐代节度使府中的高级军事参谋，负责军务策划和执行，此处王鍔兼任此职。","official_rank":"正四品或從四品","source_snippet":"以刑部尚書王鍔爲淮南副節度使兼行軍司馬","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8ac89db7-8d3c-4e6c-b842-f1f32a0be868"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":735,"link_death_year":812,"link_td_description":"杜佑，字君卿，唐代政治家、史学家，京兆万年县（在今中国陕西省西安市境）人，官至宰相，著有通典。","link_td_id":"Q10002543","link_td_number_id":239127,"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","people_xingming":"杜佑","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c27f73c2-db0e-11ef-bf5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":730,"link_death_year":815,"link_td_description":"王锷，字昆吾。自称太原人。唐朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10009680","link_td_number_id":799953,"people_name":"王鍔","people_name_jianti_auto":"王锷","people_xingming":"王锷","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"c27f73c3-db0e-11ef-8d4c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"淮南","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮南","place_note":"总部设扬州【江苏省扬州市】","resolved_place_entity_id":187,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c27f73c4-db0e-11ef-aa7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮南","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮南","resolved_place_entity_id":187,"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"c27f73c5-db0e-11ef-96a4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"5淮南節度使杜佑累表求代，冬，十月，丁亥，以刑部尚書王鍔爲淮南副節度使兼行軍司馬。","content_fanyi":"淮南节度使杜佑多次上表朝廷，请求派人接替自己的职务。冬季，十月初四日丁亥，德宗任命刑部尚书王锷为淮南副节度使，兼任行军司马。","content_jianti_auto":"5淮南节度使杜佑累表求代，冬，十月，丁亥，以刑部尚书王锷为淮南副节度使兼行军司马。","